# Optional prebuilt libphonenumber stacks for consumer iOS installs.
#
# When `libephone_phonenumber_stack-${PLATFORM_NAME}.a` exists here,
# `ios/cmake_build.sh` copies it into `ios/build/` and skips CMake.
#
# Produce archives with:
#   ./tool/prebuild_ios.sh
#   PLATFORM_NAME=iphoneos ARCHS=arm64 ./tool/prebuild_ios.sh
#
# These files are large (~50–80 MB/arch after ICU removal) and are gitignored
# by default. CI or Releases can host them for tagged publishes.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
